Description: Asteroid detection and astrometry for citizen science
 AstroFind detects and measures asteroids and other moving objects in
 astronomical images (FITS, SER, XISF, TIFF/PNG, DSLR RAW, NASA PDS) and
 writes ADES 2022 reports (XML and PSV) for the Minor Planet Center,
 following the IASC / MPC workflow.
 .
 Plate solving via astrometry.net or ASTAP, star detection (SEP), aperture
 photometry, blink comparison, moving-object detection across 3 or more
 images, dark/flat/bias calibration, and a bilingual English / Brazilian
 Portuguese interface.
